l be on  the lookout in the coming weeks and the  foreseeable future as not only will i  most likely have a video reviewing the  game's story as today is just a  retelling of its events i also plan to  make an entirely different story  explained video on a game releasing  quite soon horizon forbidden west thank  you all for watching today and if you  enjoyed make sure to like and subscribe  if you're new and as always thank you to  my returning viewers for coming back  take care everyone  and goodbye  [Music]  you
 

